---
/**
 * Optional explanation alongside discovery; no storage or account requirement
 * added. Styled as a small inline help link with a harbour chevron, not a
 * ruled strip: it sits directly under the FilterBar, and a bordered
 * disclosure there doubled the rule between the hero controls and content.
 */
---
<details class="planning-help">
  <summary>
    <span>Saving places for a trip? Here’s how</span>
    <svg class="planning-help__chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    </svg>
  </summary>
  <div class="planning-help__body">
    <p><strong>Save</strong> keeps a shortlist in <a href="/me/saved/">Saved places</a>. <strong>Add to trip</strong> puts a chosen stop into <a href="/me/trip/">My trip</a>, where you can arrange your day.</p>
    <p>You can start as a guest on this device. Saving or adding a stop does not reserve a table, room or ticket. Check opening times and bookings with the operator before travelling.</p>
  </div>
</details>
<style>
  .planning-help {
    margin-block: var(--space-3, 0.75rem) 0;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: var(--fs-300, 0.9375rem);
    color: var(--soft);
  }
  summary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4em;
    min-height: 48px;
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--harbour, #10527E);
  }
  summary > span {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary::marker { content: ''; }
  summary:hover { color: var(--harbour-h, #0C4166); }
  summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .planning-help__chevron {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    transition: transform var(--dur-fast, 120ms) var(--ease, ease);
  }
  .planning-help[open] .planning-help__chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .planning-help__chevron { transition: none; }
  }
  .planning-help__body { padding-block: var(--space-2, 0.5rem) var(--space-3, 0.75rem); }
  p { max-width: 75ch; margin: 0 0 var(--space-3, 0.75rem); line-height: 1.6; }
  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  a { color: var(--harbour, #10527E); text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
  strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
